{"module":"/assets/explain/method/method-matching.js","part":"figure","scope":"method-matching","title":"配凑：原式 = 方框 + 圆圈 + 常数","note":"例：$x>1$，求 $2x+\\frac2{x-1}$ 的最小值。按分母把 $2x$ 写成 $2(x-1)+2$，两项积为定值，补进的常数 $2$ 留在式外。","after":"compensate","version":"4c1f7fe0b6a3","html":"<div class=\"method-figure\">\n      <div class=\"method-template\"><span class=\"method-word\">原式</span><span class=\"op\">=</span><span class=\"slot square\"></span><span class=\"op\">+</span><span class=\"slot circle\"></span><span class=\"op\">+</span><span class=\"method-word\">常数</span></div>\n      <p class=\"method-demo\"><span class=\"method-demo-tag\">例</span><span class=\"method-demo-body\"><span class=\"method-demo-group\"><math><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></span><span class=\"method-demo-group\"><span class=\"op\">=</span><span class=\"term square\"><math><mn>2</mn><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math></span><span class=\"op\">+</span><span class=\"term circle\"><math><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></span><span class=\"op\">+</span><math><mn>2</mn></math></span></span></p>\n      <p class=\"method-pill\">补进的常数要在式外减回</p>\n    </div>"}
